\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces The BC$\to $RL pipeline. (a)~The PointNet encoder and actor MLP are trained end-to-end on expert demonstrations with MSE loss. (b)~The encoder is frozen and the actor MLP is fine-tuned with PPO alongside a state-based asymmetric critic. (c)~At inference the critic is discarded; the encoder and actor run deterministically.}}{7}{figure.caption.7}\protected@file@percent }
